<title>NIGERIA: Nigerian Lever Bros year profits fall.</title>
<headline>Nigerian Lever Bros year profits fall.</headline>
<dateline>LAGOS 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Full year result of Nigerian Lever Brothers to end-December 1996. (In million naira unless stated)</p>
<p>				 1996		1995</p>
<p>    Turnover		8,500    vs     8,300</p>
<p>    Profit before tax   1,900    vs     2,000</p>
<p>    Taxation		  600    vs	 500</p>
<p>    Profit after tax    1,300    vs     1,500</p>
<p>    Dividend per share  95 kobo  vs     125 kobo</p>
<p>NOTE: Payment date of dividend - June 13, 1997. Closure of register - May 12 - May 16, 1997.</p>
<p>($1=85 naira)</p>
<p>-- Lagos newsroom +234 1 263 03 17</p>
</text>
